                                "sense_id": "c33da8cc-1a14-3370-b505-4481eb4711fe",
                                "text": "So sterne strokes þay arauȝte ; eyther til oþer with strengþe\nÞat al þe erthe þer-of quaȝte ; a myle & more on lenghþe."
                            }
